  "instruction": "Open VSCode with ~/projects/python-graphql. Build a GraphQL API with Strawberry: (1) Install strawberry-graphql[fastapi] and pytest-asyncio. (2) Create src/schema/types.py defining Strawberry types: User(@strawberry.type, id, name, email, posts: list[Post]), Post(@strawberry.type, id, title, content, author: User), CreateUserInput(@strawberry.input). (3) Create src/schema/query.py with @strawberry.type Query: users() -> list[User], user(id: int) -> User | None. (4) Create src/schema/mutation.py with @strawberry.type Mutation: create_user(input: CreateUserInput) -> User. (5) Create src/main.py mounting the Strawberry GraphQL route at /graphql with FastAPI. (6) Write tests/test_schema.py executing GraphQL queries against the schema using strawberry's sync_client. Add .vscode/launch.json for debugging.",
